.venv/
_bench_tmp/
__pycache__/

# Derived artifacts. `build_corpus.py` emits pages/; `capture.py` emits shots/ and
# snapshots/. The generators plus manifest.json are the source of truth, and
# regenerating is two commands -- committing ~47k lines of rendered output would
# bury the evidence that actually matters (findings_dom.json, local_vlm_results.json,
# blind_key.json) in noise that changes on every Chromium bump.
corpus/out/pages/
corpus/out/shots/
corpus/out/snapshots/
corpus/out/blind/

# Per-run outputs of the routing and profile stages. route-plan.json and
# run_env.json are committed beside the findings files -- they are the decision
# record and the render environment, and both are small. The crops and the
# per-app rankings are regenerated by one command from those.
corpus/out/route_crops/
corpus/out/findings_ranked.*.json
